#. Key:	BriefingSayHostOnly
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(653)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(653)
